				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				411,
				11
			],
			"Message": "test(Wind): Add comprehensive test suite for configuration synchronization and file operations\n\nThis commit significantly enhances Wind's test coverage by adding comprehensive unit and integration tests for TauriConfigurationService, validating Wind's bidirectional configuration synchronization with the Mountain backend via Tauri IPC. The test suite covers key scenarios including configuration validation across application/workspace/profile scopes, conflict resolution with retry logic, configuration change event propagation, and graceful error recovery when Mountain becomes unavailable.\n\nAdded Jest configuration with proper Tauri API mocking and module mapping, enabling realistic testing of Wind's service layer without requiring the full Mountain backend. Enhanced MountainIntegrationService with improved type safety by explicitly marking optional properties as `undefined` and fixing error handling to ensure proper Error object instantiation.\n\nThe introduced test infrastructure represents a crucial milestone in Wind's production readiness, enabling continuous validation of Wind's core synchronization mechanisms as the service layer matures toward the final Effect-TS based architecture.",
			"SHA": "c65e42c428c37966844816d04be834c95d25f733"
